				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="unknownCourseTitle">
				<segment>
					<source>Unknown course</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="3d2c02e21e593bcd" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Onbekende cursus</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
		</group>
		<group id="externals">
			<group id="signin">
				<unit id="title">
					<segment>
						<source>Sign in required</source>
						<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="f6b58b088397e133" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Inloggen vereist</target>
					</segment>
				</unit>
				<unit id="description">
					<segment>
						<source>To participate in this course, you have to be signed in. No worries, it's all free. This is so we can show you your progress within the course.</source>
						<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="7552616127328062" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Om deel te nemen aan deze cursus moet je ingelogd zijn. Geen zorgen, het is allemaal gratis. Dit is zodat we je voortgang binnen de cursus aan jou kunnen tonen.</target>
					</segment>
				</unit>
			</group>
			<group id="school">
				<unit id="title">
					<segment>
						<source>School/Institution</source>
						<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="494b23de30180a83" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">School/Instituut</target>
					</segment>
				</unit>
				<unit id="description">
					<segment>
						<source>This course is taught by <pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children"><ph id="x1" type="ui" subType="xlf:var" swi18n:name="name"/></pc>.</source>
						<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="28c08193203bf688" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="ebebd1980724bc17">Dit is een <pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children"><ph id="x1" type="ui" subType="xlf:var" swi18n:name="name"/></pc> cursus.</target>
					</segment>
				</unit>
			</group>
		</group>
		<group id="students">
			<unit id="priorKnowledge">
				<segment>
					<source>Prior knowledge</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="27d57812f9dec25c" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Voorkennis</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="gradeEstimate">
				<segment>
					<source>Based on your practice so far, we expect a score of roughly <pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children"><ph id="x1" type="ui" subType="xlf:var" swi18n:name="percentage"/></pc> (about <pc id="c2" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children"><ph id="x2" type="ui" subType="xlf:var" swi18n:name="lowerPercentage"/> - <ph id="x3" type="ui" subType="xlf:var" swi18n:name="upperPercentage"/></pc>) on the final test.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="d7a30fa05d9119e3" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="40268c514e24eaf6">Gebaseerd op je oefening tot nu toe, verwachten we een score van grofweg <pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children"><ph id="x1" type="ui" subType="xlf:var" swi18n:name="percentage"/></pc> (zo'n <pc id="c2" type="ui" subType="swi18n:strong" swi18n:slot="children"><ph id="x2" type="ui" subType="xlf:var" swi18n:name="lowerPercentage"/> - <ph id="x3" type="ui" subType="xlf:var" swi18n:name="upperPercentage"/></pc>) op de eindtoets.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="disclaimer">
				<segment>
					<source>No rights can be derived from this estimate.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="f54a674d337d1594" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Aan deze schatting kunnen geen rechten worden ontleend.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="practiceRecommendation">
				<segment>
					<source>This is currently the recommended skill to practice.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="52542a5e01f57ea3" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Dit is nu de aanbevolen vaardigheid om te oefenen.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="sufficientMastery">
				<segment>
					<source>You have sufficiently mastered this skill.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="178fc18378330fcc" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Je beheerst deze vaardigheid goed.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="followUpMastery">
				<segment>
					<source>You have mastered a follow-up skill, so we mark this one as sufficient as well.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="5f69c36971f0ad78" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Je beheerst een vervolg-vaardigheid, dus markeren we deze ook als voldoende.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="noExercises">
				<segment>
					<source>This skill has no exercises yet. They are probably coming soon.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="bbaeea22dddbea2e" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Deze vaardigheid heeft nog geen opgaven. Ze komen er waarschijnlijk binnenkort aan.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="noSkills">
				<segment>
					<source>This block is still under development: no skills/exercises have been added yet. They will be here shortly!</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="58d449c7576a31f0" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Dit blok is nog in ontwikkeling: er zijn nog geen vaardigheden/oefeningen toegevoegd. Ze komen er zo snel mogelijk aan!</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
		</group>
		<group id="teachers">
			<unit id="noStudents">
				<segment>
					<source><pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:par" swi18n:slot="children">Your course is ready, but there are no students yet. Share the <pc id="c2" type="ui" subType="swi18n:link" swi18n:slot="children">course link</pc> (this page's URL) with students, or ask them to <pc id="c3" type="ui" subType="swi18n:link" swi18n:slot="children">add the course</pc> from the full list.</pc><pc id="c4" type="ui" subType="swi18n:par" swi18n:slot="children">For further options, check out the <pc id="c5" type="ui" subType="swi18n:link" swi18n:slot="children">Course Settings</pc> (top right).</pc></source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="3124f718a7d677f4" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="7dbe65e5ee38e15f"><pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:par" swi18n:slot="children">Je cursus staat klaar, maar er zijn nog geen studenten. Deel de <pc id="c2" type="ui" subType="swi18n:link" swi18n:slot="children">cursuslink</pc> (de URL van deze pagina) met studenten, of vraag ze om zelf de <pc id="c3" type="ui" subType="swi18n:link" swi18n:slot="children">cursus toe te voegen</pc> uit de lijst.</pc><pc id="c4" type="ui" subType="swi18n:par" swi18n:slot="children">Voor meer opties, zie de <pc id="c5" type="ui" subType="swi18n:link" swi18n:slot="children">Cursusinstellingen</pc> (rechtsboven).</pc></target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
